 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello, how are things going?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.44,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hanging in there.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The caulk around my tub is all moldy and gross. Can I just put new caulk over it, Moshi?",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg4",
   "kind": "moshi_name",
   "name_pos": "end",
   "addressee": "Moshi",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It's better not to. New caulk won't stick well over old caulk, and the mold will come right back.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hold on, really?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg4",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_11",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "I'm fairly sure about it, but I could be wrong. What sounds off to you?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.47,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ugh. So I have to scrape it all off?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 2.51,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg4",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Yes, a plastic scraper or a utility knife works. Then clean the gap with some rubbing alcohol and let it dry completely.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How long does it need before I can shower again?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg4",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Most silicone caulk wants about a full day. Check the tube, some fast cure ones are ready sooner.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, I'll do it Friday night",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.5,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "home_repair.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "so it's ready by Saturday evening.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.53,
   "block": "home_repair.dlg4",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Perfect timing. Tape both edges before you caulk and you'll get a really clean line.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.35,
